# CORR-001 — Analyst Response Workflow

## Alert Metadata

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Alert | CORR-001 — Multi-Stage Windows Attack Activity |
| Severity | Critical |
| Minimum Detection Count | 3 |
| Correlation Window | 60 minutes |

---

## Purpose

This workflow defines the analyst response process when CORR-001 identifies multiple suspicious Windows behaviors within the same investigation window.

The objective is to determine whether the correlated activity represents:

- Legitimate administration
- Authorized security testing
- A false positive
- Suspicious activity requiring additional investigation
- A confirmed incident requiring containment

---

